70:     """
71:     Recolor each grey diagonal band by extending the horizontal marker palette through its diagonal layers.
72: 
73:     Input structure
74:     - The background is dominant, with one contiguous horizontal row of colored
75:       marker pixels and one or more grey diagonal bands.
76:     - Each grey band has a slanted rectangular-ribbon shape with a flat top cap
77:       at the end nearest the marker row.
78: 
79:     Rule
80:     - Keep the background and marker pixels unchanged.
81:     - For each grey band, normalize its slant so the top cap begins at local
82:       column zero, then use the layer min(row_offset, col_offset), clipped to
83:       the final layer at the far cap.
